hs_err_pid*

# Personal data & third-party copyrighted material the public repo shouldn't ship
# These stay in the local working directory only.
/Budget Tracking Tool - TMOAP v5.xlsx
/qayd_android_budget_app_prd.md
/دليل جماليات خط ثمانية.pdf
/authar logo.png
/authar logo no background.png
/thmanyah typeface/

# Built APKs — kept locally for sideload, never published to git.
